            "review_title": "Review at The Mechanic",
            "review_text": "Dragine\nTübingen, Germany187 contributions\n0\nReally good\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nThis cocktail bar has the quality you would expect from a 5* hotel. Interesting decoration, pleasant and not too loud background music.\nBut above all, the cocktails are top notch. We had Cosmopolitan, Long Time no See and My Mechanic. Simply delicious.\nAlso highly recommended: the great French fries. But be careful: the whole thing isn't free.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 21, 2024",
